[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12067.67, "timestamp": "03:21:07", "text": "天哪，你能拿到食物嗎？我的耳機快沒電了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12091.269, "timestamp": "03:21:31", "text": "喔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.91, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "不，我好害怕。是的，我在這裡。等等，我其實不知道怎麼下去。糟糕，我死了。我們怎麼下去？這就像我們拿水桶。我去拿個水桶好嗎？哦，等等，我可以去拿，然後拿些食物。還有食物。好吧，呃，我的東西……我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12101.018, "timestamp": "03:21:41", "author": "@SuzukiZurikoVTuber", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/852SZLheWUnfQGntgjphW0AD17oXLR9MhuzMLEzOm451wzhCllgmSUMTMpDu7wtBK7HSHR9J=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "on my way!!!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12108.229, "timestamp": "03:21:48", "text": "直覺告訴我跳下去。我可以跳嗎？不不不不不不。"}]